msgctxt "64"
msgid ""
"Sir, would you mind waiting outside? We've got a full house,\r\n"
"but you're welcome to wait for a spot to open up..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "Oh, Kiryu-san! Welcome! Come by to take a load off?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"This girl's pretty cute. I heard she's from Okinawa.\r\n"
"She really knows how to soothe this old heart of mine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "Kaede-chan, could I get another order of rafute and a beer, hon?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Coming right up! You should have some vegetables, too, y'know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "This job is perfect for me. It's so much fun, too!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "Yeah? That's good to hear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"I swear, all the men in Tokyo are always exhausted.\r\n"
"They come here to eat and drink their troubles away so they\r\n"
"can give it their all again tomorrow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"Kaede-chan, it's thanks to you that we can keep chuggin'\r\n"
"along. Your Okinawan accent is so nice and relaxing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"Ehehe... That's nice of you to say, sir. Here, have this on\r\n"
"the house. Eat up!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"Well, if it isn't Kiryu-san! It's been how many years now?\r\n"
"God, this brings back memories!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "Aren't you Yuuya's friend's..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "That's me! It's been two years, right? Quite a while."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "Yeah. Looks like business is booming."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"It's all thanks to Kaede-chan! She said that someone named\r\n"
"Kiryu convinced her to come to Tokyo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "I had an inkling that might've been you. Turns out it was!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "Looks like business is booming."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid ""
"It's all thanks to Kaede-chan! She said that someone named\r\n"
"Kiryu convinced her to come to Tokyo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid ""
"And she's simply amazing! Here, take this. A token\r\n"
"of my thanks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "You got <Color:8>50,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto <Color:8>50.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "352"
msgid ""
"I just kept getting fired from job after job... I was\r\n"
"starting to think that I couldn't make it in Tokyo. But\r\n"
"after coming here, I know I just gotta keep trying my best!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "That's the spirit. This place might be a good fit for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid ""
"We're completely packed right now, so you'll have to\r\n"
"swing by again later. When you do, it'll be on the house,\r\n"
"Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "You got 3,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

